      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "If $h=5,$ then $3(h-8)+11=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "We replace $h$ with $5$ in the expression and evaluate the parentheses first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(h-8)+11 & = \\\\ 3(5-8)+11 & = \\\\ 3(-3)+11 & = \\\\ -9+11 & = \\\\ 2 & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
